WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.350
<i>Let's go to heaven together.</i>

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.070
<i>Thus begins our trip to hell.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.020
W-What should I do?!

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:11.030
It's no longer capisce!

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.420
You want Lala to join Alomagedon-pri?

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:51.600
Exactly.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.000
Come Lala,

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.670
partake in this forbidden apple and become our partner.

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.840
With this you should quietly obey us.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.800
L-Like I said, I-

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.020
She's not interested-pri!

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.220
What?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:05.730
Nano?

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.460
Lala is a vital member of SoLaMi Smile-pri.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.480
I won't let you take her-pri.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:16.700
It would seem thee do not understand the horror which befalls those who defy us demons.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:20.760
It's more like being a demon doesn't suit an idol-pri.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:21.450
Oh?

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:24.550
Idols are meant to bring everyone happiness,

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:27.040
so acting like a demon is a complete failure-pri.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.170
You better rethink your character image-pri.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:34.470
Your pri this and pri that character trait is completely shallow!

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:35.460
Why you!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:42.020
A strange demon such as yourself would never understand the depth of my pop character.

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:43.890
Mirelle's right.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.680
I have no intention of leaving SoLaMi Smile.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.620
I'm sorry.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.400
I won't join Spring Roll Bowl.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.780
It's not Spring Roll Bowl!

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:57.860
It's Alomagedon!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:58.550
Alomage!

00:02:58.550 --> 00:02:58.810
Thanks, Mirelle.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:02:59.300
Alomage!

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.070
A-lo-ma-ge!

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.860
I was just stating the obvious-pri.

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.280
The three of us will always be together.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.250
A spring roll bowl sounds delicious-nano.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.470
<i>I'm not good at dealing with these kinds of humans.</i>

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:15.090
<i>I must hastily cast those who defy my prophecy into the darkness.</i>

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.550
<i>In that case...</i>

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.520
Hear this, Mirelle.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.010
Pr-

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:23.180
Under the next full moon, your soul shall be sold to the devil,

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.220
and SoLaMi Smile shall be no more.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.330
Pri?

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:32.860
The final results of the genuine vote are in.

00:03:32.860 --> 00:03:36.110
Paprika Academy's next student council president is...

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.360
...Minami Mirelle!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.280
You may cheer.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:44.490
Awesome!

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.770
Congratulations!

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:52.960
I'll be able to watch over her as the assistant treasurer's understudy once again.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.790
What is it?

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.860
Tell mama.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.400
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:05.580
You want to see Minami-san's student council president inauguration PriPara concert?

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.340
Wow! What a nice idea, Rina-chan!

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:12.640
And to top it off, she'll be performing a special solo concert.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.180
Now then, a few words from Minami-san.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.390
Thank you all so much.

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:26.790
So that I don't soil the position of student council president,

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:30.370
I will put extra effort into my studies, and of course, PriPara!

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.620
Yeah! Hooray! Capisce!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.630
Complete-pri!

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:41.590
Pri?

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.510
Look, it's the two from Alomagedon!

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.820
That was a wonderful and mysterious début concert.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.020
Devidevi.

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.970
I'm a believer.
Mika! Mika! Mikan!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.420
They even invited Lala-chan to join their team.

00:04:52.420 --> 00:04:54.530
I wonder what'll happen.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:55.700
Hm.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:58.160
They're quite popular-pri.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.190
Now that I think about it...

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:03.320
Under the next full moon, your soul shall be sold to the devil,

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.400
and SoLaMi Smile shall be no more.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.130
She said something really weird back then...

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.160
But it's probably not worth worrying about-pri.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.790
Mirelle!

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:14.830
Congrats on your solo concert.

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:16.460
Thanks,

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.050
but you can do a solo concert whenever you want-pri.

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.880
This one is special.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:23.630
Here.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:24.850
Huh?

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:25.720
What's this?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.450
I got you a present.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:27.840
What?

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.490
Remeber how I had that hair accessory in my last concert?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:36.830
Well, I asked Mega-neesan to make a few with different colours.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.090
Okay!

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:38.760
Here.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.880
I'm sure she'll be happy when she receives it.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.660
I got one for you too, Sophie.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:45.980
For me too?

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:46.860
Yeah.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.160
If the three of us have a matching set,

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.620
I'm sure we'll be able to reform soon.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.180
Thanks!

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:55.160
How embarrassing-pri.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:55.580
Huh?

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:59.240
Having you give me such a wonderful present,

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:01.540
I'm so happy it's embarrassing-pri.

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:03.050
Mirelle...

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.270
Thank you-pri!

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.510
This signals the start of SoLaMi Smile's reformation!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:13.560
With this, tomorrow's concert will be absolutely perfect-pri!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:15.520
Great! I'll be cheering for you!

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.190
Derodero!

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.900
Kuma?

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.110
Here you are-nekon.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:27.070
With the three of them willing to go that far to reform,

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:31.160
maybe I should man up and face this curse head on-kuma.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.280
Neko!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:35.750
H-How mean-nekon!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:36.700
Huh?

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.830
So you really don't believe me-nekon?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:43.090
I even gave you that warning because I was worried about you, Kuma-chan.

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.010
You're an idiot, moron, imbecile, Kuma-chan!

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:47.620
I don't know you any more-nekon.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:50.970
Cheer up, Neko-neesan-kuma!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:52.930
Look at me-kuma.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.350
Here! Come play!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.080
Here-ereere...

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:00.190
Oh, just this once...

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.250
How irresistible!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.440
I won't hesitate any more-kuma!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.400
I truly enjoy being afraid to death by this curse!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.610
I'll leave that lump of cotton to Neko.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:17.560
Derodero derosaimu!

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.250
Awaken, my mischievous servant!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.280
Wow.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.580
1, 2, 3, 4!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.870
1, 2, 3, 4-pri!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.440
I'll make tomorrow's concert a hit no matter what-pri!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.440
And on top of that,

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.250
Lala's present makes me so happy-pri!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.500
What's this?! What's going on?!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.640
That was frightening-pri.

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.800
I wonder what that was-pri.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:09.090
She's yet to understand how terrible my curse is.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.340
Prepare yourself, Mirelle.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.300
That's enough practice-pri.

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.400
With this, tomorrow will be perfect!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:22.270
Huh?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.370
Lala's present...

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:26.160
Huh?

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:26.980
Huh?!

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:31.400
How'd it... get up there?

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.830
I can't reach!

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:39.040
Huh?

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:39.790
It's not there-pri!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.750
Pri? Pri?!

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.240
Pri!

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.390
Where is it-pri?!

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.000
How?

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.460
Why's it in the hallway?

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.170
Pri?

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:53.800
It's gone...

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.340
Why?

00:08:55.340 --> 00:09:03.730
Pri?

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.290
Why?!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.190
The present is running away-pri!

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:10.110
It's not here! Or here! Or here!

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.610
Or here! Or here! Or here!

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:15.970
Where did it run off to?!

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.490
What should I do?

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:22.490
I've completely lost track of it-pri.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.170
Mirelle!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:28.630
Lala...

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:31.410
What time is your concert tomorrow?

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:33.880
W-Well, you know...

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:39.180
<i>I should be honest and tell her I lost her present-pri!</i>

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.100
Lie to her.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.120
Sell thine soul to the devil.

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.810
I-I wouldn't...

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.890
Don't do it-nano!

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.370
You should tell her the truth.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:51.270
Huh?

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:52.800
Lie to her.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.040
The truth.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:54.970
Lie.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:55.740
Truth!

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.260
Geez!
The present ran away?!

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.020
Hold on-pri. Pri pri!

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.890
Who would believe such a thing?!

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.210
If thee tell her the truth, thine life will become hell.

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:05.500
By hurting Lala's feelings, she'll end up leaving thee,

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.920
thus signaling the end of SoLaMi Smile.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.880
I don't want to lose her-pri!

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.380
Lying is bad-nano.

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:16.650
Lying is the worst thing to do in a relationship-nano.

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:18.940
If you do that, Lala-chan will be shocked, get angry,

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:22.320
and never want to see you again!

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.520
What?!

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:26.540
Lie to her.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.820
Don't.

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:28.770
Tell her the truth.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.020
Lie! Lie! Devi devi! Lie! Lie!
Yes, truth! Gel gel! Truth! Truth!

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:34.400
The angel or demon...

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.740
The outcome will be horrible no matter who I side with-pri!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.700
What's going on, Mirelle?

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.590
N-Nothing-pri.

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.000
I'm so happy!

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.120
I'm glad my present has made you so happy!

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:53.590
Lala, about that, um...

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:54.950
Beep! *fuzzzz*

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.300
S-Sorry!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.420
I'm losing....

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:58.650
*fuzzzzzz* Beep!

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.590
...signal! Beep!

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.760
*fuzzzzzzz*

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:07.430
Attention idols.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:12.780
This is to inform you that we'll be starting our periodic checks of hologramation and that the sky will be switched to night.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:14.400
This was a system message!

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.970
Under the next full moon...

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:23.070
...SoLaMi Smile shall be no more.

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:28.320
Here.

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.670
Hooray!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:35.270
The more beautiful the friendship, the more beautiful it is to crush it.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:38.800
The more delicious the meat bun, the more delicious it is to eat it!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.760
Mirelle is a single step away from destruction.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.210
And thus!

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:43.970
Yum! Yum!

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:46.460
Lala, Shion, Dorthy!

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:51.940
I shall tempt those three into forming the Dream Team Dream Alomagedon!

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.400
Yummy yum!

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:10.370
I wasn't able to find Lala's present.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:13.090
And I even said that it signaled the beginning of our reformation.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:15.500
Mirelle!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.160
Isn't it about time for your solo concert?

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.730
Y-Yeah.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:21.050
You should change into your coord soon.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.980
I probably should...

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:27.050
But to tell you the truth...

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.520
I'm going to be wearing a different coord-pri!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:31.810
Huh?

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.630
According to various calculations,

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:37.420
I've found that this coord is the best match for today's concert-pri!

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:41.290
Because of that, I won't be able to wear the hair accessory you gave me-pri.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.910
It's unfortunate-pri.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.390
I see...

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.760
Capisce.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.290
Seeing as you calculated it, it must be right!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.500
O-Of course!

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:57.920
I'll do my best to "A pop and a step and I've gotcha!" as ever!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.840
All right, it's about time for my concert!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.960
I didn't have a choice-pri.

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:13.730
I had to-pri.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.830
But...

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.940
The hand you used with "gotcha" earlier...

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.150
Eh?!

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:23.910
...was off by one jellyfish leg.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.810
What's wrong?

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.330
H-How could you tell-pri?

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:33.790
I just could.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:37.970
Sophie...

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:39.670
You see...

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.890
It's time for your concert.

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.210
Please hurry.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.890
H-Hello everyone!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:59.610
Thank you for coming to Mirelle's Paprika Academy Student Council President Inaugural special concert today!

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.320
I hope we have a lot of fun together-pri!

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.030
Together...

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:12.200
<i>Seeing as you calculated it, it must be right!</i>

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.160
<i>I just could.</i>

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:19.830
Mirelle?

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.800
I'm sorry.

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:29.510
To be honest, I lost the present a very important friend of mine gave me.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:30.530
Huh?

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:36.180
I can't sing like this.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:37.430
So...

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:38.890
Mirelle...

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.220
So today's concert will-

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:41.860
Huh?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.490
Oh!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.980
Sophie, I have something I need to take care of!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.750
Just what's going on?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.530
I'm sure everything will be fine.

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.010
Until then, pushuu~.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:02.960
Sophie-san!

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.310
I'm not sure what's going on,

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:06.890
but we have to do something!

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:07.670
Let's do it.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.680
Please stick around, everyone,

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.770
Mirelle will be back shortly.

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:18.980
Until then, we'll entertain you.

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.490
Let's go!

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:21.300
Yeah.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.940
Tension max!

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.820
Relax.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.400
Delicious!

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.040
How'd it get over here?!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.800
This time...!

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:37.580
What?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.000
Haven't you heard?

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:43.170
The Dream Theatre is still under construction-panda.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:44.060
Out'ta the way! Out'ta the way!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.000
Eh?!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.170
I-It's over-pri!

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:56.850
Eh?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.060
Deko?

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:02.270
What the-pri?!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.920
Mine servant has revealed it's true form.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.740
A frog-nano?

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.460
You summoned that-nano?

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.240
Yeah.

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:13.200
However, there's something I still don't understand.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.220
Why?

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:17.830
Lala's here.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.140
Mirelle!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:22.260
Lala...

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:24.810
I'm sorry.

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:28.540
I forgot to actually put the ribbon in the box!

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:29.950
What?!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.760
I was in a rush to give it to you,

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.050
and didn't make sure that I actually put it in the box the previous night.

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.410
T-That's what happened...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.060
I'm really sorry.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:48.250
No, if I had not lied and just told you the truth, we would have figured it out sooner-pri.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:54.810
But I was afraid you'd get upset and leave us.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.030
I'm sorry.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.240
I'd never leave.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:04.410
Regardless of what happens, both Sophie and I love you!

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:05.500
Lala...

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:07.710
Thank you, Lala.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.180
Huh?

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:12.170
This is the first time I've been thanked for accidentally screwing up.

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:17.090
So that's what happened.

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.580
I thought I'd play a trick on her,

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.890
but when I opened the box,

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.620
it was empty for some reason.

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.250
I continued with the plan and put a frog inside,

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.060
but something still felt off.

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.480
Tricks are bad-nano.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.960
You're right.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.680
But it's a demon's job to trick people.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:37.570
Then it's an angel's job to put an end to those tricks.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.230
Here's a meat and potato bun. Eat up.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:42.540
Delicious!

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:47.960
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.770
Coord Change Start!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:57.340
By making bold use of the vivid colours,
even a cute design can be transformed into pop!

00:17:57.670 --> 00:18:00.760
And the colour of the hair pin Lala-san chose is a perfect match!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.020
Dream Heart Race Coord!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:03.850
Pri!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.040
Somehow we lasted long enough.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.540
We'll leave the rest to you.

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.230
Relax.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.880
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.070
I found my present!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.410
The power of friendship will make this a special concert-pri!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:21.950
Hooray!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:19:33.310
Pri!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:36.440
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:51.210
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:55.380
Cyalume Change!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.340
Pri!

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:43.210
Way to go, Mirelle!

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:44.710
It was awesome!

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:46.760
Brilliantly done, Student Council President!

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:52.290
Thank you-pri!

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.190
Mirelle-chan has blue.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:58.900
Pop!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:03.190
That was great, Mirelle!

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:04.070
Yeah.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.820
It's all thanks to you two-pri.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:07.600
All right!

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:10.450
Let's work even harder towards our reformation-pri!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:11.040
Yeah.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.040
Capisce!

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:13.210
What's this?

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:15.000
It seems we failed-nekon.

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:18.250
Next time will be a pizza bun!

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.210
I guess I'll have to get serious.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:24.670
The next prophecy; chapter 4, section 44:

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:30.270
"The dark arrow let loose by a demon shall pursue the red haired maiden."

00:23:06.410 --> 00:23:08.120
La la lala~.

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:10.360
You're sure in high spirits, Sophie.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:14.380
My beloved father will be returning from abroad soon.

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:16.620
Oh? What's your father like?

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:22.480
He's like a jellyfish, a whale shark, and a footballfish all in one.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:24.410
I don't know how to imagine that.

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:27.540
It seems he has something important to talk about.

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:28.290
Next time:

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:29.800
The Man From Brazil.

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:31.770
Wild!

00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:33.170
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:33.170 --> 00:23:34.760
Let's go PriPara!
